# Classifier — project context

Single-file app: `index.html` (HTML+CSS+JS+mammoth). `file://` OK; do not require localhost. Assistant replies in Russian unless the user writes in English.

## Storage modes

1. **IndexedDB** — catalog + file blobs (main working mode after migration).
2. **External package** — `catalog.json` + `files/<id>/…` + `classifier-package.v1.json` beside the HTML.

Resolve file bytes: IDB blob → file handle → package file. Do **not** trust `hasBlob` from a foreign catalog; check real IDB blobs.

### Package / migration UX

- On `file://`, sibling `fetch` often fails → orange **«Указать папку пакета»** (user click only).
- When files live on disk and IDB has no blobs → red **«В IndexedDB»** + banner with detailed hint.
- Never call `showDirectoryPicker` on boot or after `confirm` (Edge user-gesture error).
- Migration copies into IndexedDB, then deletes only `files/<id>/` under the package folder if writable. Keep HTML + `catalog.json`.

## Full backup

Portable runnable package: `Classifier.html` + `index.html` (DOM snapshot before boot — not `fetch` on `file://`) + `catalog.json` + marker + `files/` + README. Folder backup can resume after F5; ZIP cannot.

## UI notes

- Add buttons on classifier bar: **+** / **+T** / **+✎**. File: Download, Delete; tags under name.
- Expanding preview scrolls the files list so the row stays in view.
- Transfer dock: on error show Close / header ×; auto-dismiss errors ~8s.

## Preview

Text, image, audio, video, PDF, DOCX. No DjVu / old `.doc` preview.

